qos: shader refs from 007's fastfiles, so a shipped refs file (pipelines/*.refs next to the exe, made by the game's
tools/ff_shader_refs.py from a pipeline manifest) preloads every shader and pipeline it lists without carrying the
game's microcode. The refs reader reads `<path>.ff` sources as offsets into the decompressed zone (7-dword big-endian
header, the zone's size in dword 1, then one zlib stream at byte 28; inflated with stb_image's zlib decoder, ~1 s for
a 220 MB level zone), trying other language folders when the named one is missing; the zone is freed after loading.
Shaders rebuilt from refs are appended to <title>.master.bin in the cache folder, so later starts read no game file.

